<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">Regardless of tough situation due to space limit on CKI, we would like to comply with 40T QTA for SINWA if it is inevitable choice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">Based on last CKI PFMC, we would like to suggest QTA breakdown as below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
