<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">** Although BOMBB has higher CM level than RGNBA, we would like to give allocation to RGNBA due to garment cargoes ex MM with sensitive T/T time.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">** We will try to fully utilize space ex JKT ~ SIN ~ KHH with spare space and strictly control space within 40T into KR &amp; CN.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#0000CC">3)) Effective VVD</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black"> : KKIC1315E (JKT ETA 2 DEC)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">Please update QTA as per actual PFMC on HSSZ1303E &amp; SNRF1315E since we controlled space to release more space to KHH.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black">Thanks.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
