<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">As we already&nbsp;informed through the other channels,
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><strong><u><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">please be notfied that BSA of CKI will be consistently&nbsp;decreased effective from SNRF1315W/E,</span></u></strong><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><strong><u><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">which means that all loading offices's QTA and actual&nbsp;loading volumes should be down fitting into total BSA.</span></u></strong><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">This has been made at short notice due to the stake in the space swap between Indonesia lanes with our partners,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">please seek your understanding and refer to the guideline.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><img border="0" width="758" height="204" id="_x0000_i1029" src="cid:image010.jpg@01CEE9FE.5E3BDEB0"></span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">As&nbsp;BSA&nbsp;will be&nbsp;decreased from 200 Teus to 100 Teus, QTA will be adjusted from CCE/ASI&nbsp;soon,
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">however all loading offices are adivsed in advance to&nbsp;follow the instruction below in order to prevent any confusion for cargoes handling.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">* SELBB &amp; SHABB&nbsp;:&nbsp;The allocation has been down, please&nbsp;divert the cargoe to NCI/HNNB0064W</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; We will allocate more as the deducted portion onto NCI/HNNB0064W
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">* NBOBB : Due to the limited network to JKT, we will remain the current alloation, however to utilize the space fully,
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; check the f'cast and then make a correct f'cast.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Copy to CCE/ASI/WSI</span></strong><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">- Please promptly adjust the QTA by each office on CKI within the BSA and infrom to all office.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp; When you make a new QTA, please refer to the factors below.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. As you&nbsp;know well, NBOBB don't have any option for Indonesia service except for CKI</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp;On&nbsp;CKI,&nbsp;the minimum space&nbsp;to SHA should be&nbsp;allocated&nbsp;by&nbsp;considering into some customers like&nbsp;Philps's loading and&nbsp;no show&nbsp;ratio.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp; 3.&nbsp;Due to the limited network from KHH to PUS&nbsp;for&nbsp;TPEBB,&nbsp;at least 60 teus on weekly basis should be guaranteed&nbsp;on&nbsp;Yield&nbsp;MGMT&nbsp;Concept&nbsp;under
 the&nbsp;tough situation&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Please contact CTY - AE if you have a question.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
